## 13. API Design Principles

Base path `/api/v1`. JSON only (except PDF). Plural nouns, nested resources for resume-owned analyses. Standard methods and status codes: 200/201/204, 400 (validation), 401, 403, 404, 409, 413, 429, 500, 503. Auth via `Authorization: Bearer <access>` except `/auth/*`, `/templates`, `/health`. Dates ISO-8601 UTC. IDs are Mongo ObjectId strings. `PATCH /resumes/:id` requires `baseRevision`.

**Success envelope:** `{ "data": <payload>, "meta"?: { ... } }`  
**Error envelope:** `{ "error": { "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR", "message": "…", "details"?: [{ "path": "email", "message": "…" }], "requestId": "…" } }`

