### `resumes`
```ts
{ _id, userId: ObjectId,
  title: string, templateId: 'modern-professional'|'minimal-ats'|'software-engineer'|'fresher-student',
  settings: { accentColor: string /* hex from palette */, fontScale: 'sm'|'md'|'lg', spacing: 'compact'|'normal'|'relaxed' },
  personalInfo: { fullName, headline, email, phone, location, links: { id, label, url }[] },
  sections: Section[],               // ordered; order = render order
  completion: number,                // 0-100, recomputed on every save
  lastAtsScore: number | null,       // denormalised from latest analysis
  revision: number,                  // starts at 1, +1 per successful PATCH
  isSample: boolean,
  createdAt, updatedAt }
// indexes: { userId: 1, updatedAt: -1 }, { userId: 1, title: 1 }
```
### `Section` (embedded; validated by Zod discriminated union, stored as Mixed `data`)
```ts
type SectionType = 'summary'|'education'|'skills'|'experience'|'internships'|'projects'|'certifications'|'achievements'|'extracurricular'|'languages'|'custom';
interface SectionBase { id: string /* uuid */; type: SectionType; title: string; visible: boolean }
type Section =
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'summary'; data: { text: string } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'education'; data: { entries: { id; institution; degree; field; location; startDate; endDate; current: boolean; grade; details: string[] }[] } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'skills'; data: { groups: { id; category: string; items: string[] }[] } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'experience'|'internships'|'extracurricular'; data: { entries: { id; role; organization; location; startDate; endDate; current: boolean; bullets: string[] }[] } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'projects'; data: { entries: { id; name; link; techStack: string[]; startDate; endDate; bullets: string[] }[] } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'certifications'; data: { entries: { id; name; issuer; date; link }[] } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'achievements'; data: { entries: { id; title; date; description }[] } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'languages'; data: { entries: { id; language; proficiency: 'Native'|'Fluent'|'Professional'|'Intermediate'|'Basic' }[] } })
 | (SectionBase & { type: 'custom'; data: { entries: { id; title; subtitle; date; bullets: string[] }[] } });
```
Rules: dates `"YYYY-MM"` or `""`; every entry has a client-generated UUID `id`; at most one section per non-custom type; server re-validates the **entire** `sections` array with Zod on every PATCH and recomputes `completion`.

### `analyses`
```ts
{ _id, userId, resumeId (index), type: 'ats'|'job-match', hasJobDescription: boolean,
  jobTitle?: string, company?: string, jobDescriptionHash?: string /* SHA-256, JD text NOT stored */,
  result: object /* AtsReport or JobMatchResult */, overall?: number, createdAt }
// index { resumeId: 1, type: 1, createdAt: -1 }; keep latest 10 per (resume,type) — prune on insert
```
> The raw JD text is not stored (privacy); only its hash and the computed result.

